<%- include('Navbar.ejs') %>

<link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/privacy-policy.css" />

<main class="privacy-page">
  <div class="privacy-container">
    <div class="privacy-layout">

      <article class="privacy-document">
        <section class="privacy-section" id="information">
          <span class="privacy-section-number">01</span>
          <div>
            <h2>Information we handle</h2>
            <p>
              Information may include account and contact details, profile or
              business information, tender and bid details, and messages or
              documents you choose to submit. Basic technical information,
              such as browser and device data, may also be processed when you
              use the site.
            </p>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section class="privacy-section" id="purposes">
          <span class="privacy-section-number">02</span>
          <div>
            <h2>How information is used</h2>
            <p>
              Information may be used to operate the service, support your
              account, facilitate tender and project workflows, respond to
              requests, maintain platform safety, and meet applicable legal
              requirements. We aim to use information for purposes related to
              the features you choose to use.
            </p>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section class="privacy-section" id="sharing">
          <span class="privacy-section-number">03</span>
          <div>
            <h2>Sharing information</h2>
            <p>
              Information may be available to other users when required for a
              feature you choose, such as a tender, bid, or project
              interaction. It may also be handled by service providers
              supporting platform operations, or disclosed when required by
              law.
            </p>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section class="privacy-section" id="security">
          <span class="privacy-section-number">04</span>
          <div>
            <h2>Security and retention</h2>
            <p>
              We use reasonable measures intended to protect information, but
              no online service can guarantee absolute security. Information
              is retained as needed to provide the service, address
              operational needs, resolve disputes, or meet legal obligations,
              and is then handled or deleted as appropriate.
            </p>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section class="privacy-section" id="your-choices">
          <span class="privacy-section-number">05</span>
          <div>
            <h2>Your choices</h2>
            <p>
              Keep your account details accurate and avoid submitting
              sensitive information that is not needed for a platform
              feature. You may contact us to ask about access, correction, or
              deletion requests. We may need to verify your identity and
              consider applicable requirements before responding.
            </p>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section class="privacy-section" id="cookies">
          <span class="privacy-section-number">06</span>
          <div>
            <h2>Cookies and analytics</h2>
            <p>
              The website or its service providers may use browser storage,
              cookies, or similar technologies to support functionality,
              remember preferences, and understand service usage. You can
              manage cookies through your browser settings; disabling them
              may affect some features.
            </p>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section class="privacy-section" id="children">
          <span class="privacy-section-number">07</span>
          <div>
            <h2>Children's privacy</h2>
            <p>
              Maha Contract is intended for people able to enter into
              applicable agreements. The service is not designed for children,
              and we do not knowingly seek personal information from
              children.
            </p>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section class="privacy-section" id="changes">
          <span class="privacy-section-number">08</span>
          <div>
            <h2>Policy changes</h2>
            <p>
              We may revise this policy as the service or applicable
              requirements change. The latest version and its effective date
              will be available on this page.
            </p>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section class="privacy-section" id="contact">
          <span class="privacy-section-number">09</span>
          <div>
            <h2>Contact us</h2>
            <p>
              For privacy-related questions or requests, please
              <a href="/contact-us">contact our team</a>. You can also review
              our <a href="/terms-of-service">Terms of Service</a>.
            </p>
          </div>
        </section>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</main>

<%- include('Footer.ejs') %>
